<title>FINLAND: FINNISH JULY NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 7.4 PCT Y/Y.</title>
<headline>FINNISH JULY NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 7.4 PCT Y/Y.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registrations of new private cars</p>
<p>in Finland rose 7.4 percent year-on-year in July to 8,242 units,</p>
<p>the Information Centre of the Automobile Branch said in a</p>
<p>monthly review on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
